      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanFactoryPostProcessor</code></a> that ensures that the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/aspectj/AnnotationBeanConfigurerAspect.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.aspectj\"><code>AnnotationBeanConfigurerAspect</code></a> aspect is up and\nrunning <em>before</em> the <code>EntityManagerFactory</code> gets created as this already instantiates\nentity listeners and we need to get injection into <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/annotation/Configurable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>Configurable</code></a>\nto work in them.",
      "translation": "一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanFactoryPostProcessor</code></a>，用于确保在<code>EntityManagerFactory</code>创建之前，<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/aspectj/AnnotationBeanConfigurerAspect.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.aspectj\"><code>AnnotationBeanConfigurerAspect</code></a>切面已经正常运行。这是因为<code>EntityManagerFactory</code>的创建会立即实例化实体监听器，而我们需要在它们中实现向<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/annotation/Configurable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>Configurable</code></a>的注入才能正常工作。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html#postProcessBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.config.ConfigurableListableBeanFactory)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\">postProcessBeanFactory</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\">BeanFactoryPostProcessor</a></code>",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html#postProcessBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.config.ConfigurableListableBeanFactory)\" title=\"类或接口 org.springframework.beans.factory.config\">postProcessBeanFactory</a></code> 在接口 <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html\" title=\"类或接口 org.springframework.beans.factory.config\">BeanFactoryPostProcessor</a></code> 中",
      "count": 1
